// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3493312836" "You hitched a ride into Fort Trident on the belly of this submarine. Time to pay Michael White a visit, for old time's sake."
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P942165609" "And that's how it all went down..."
// ExitStringFail :
"P3586193987" "Wait, no, that isn't how it happened..."
