// Script Variable Caption :
"P1911496879" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Eagle Eye: Security tapes confirm that Deadlock slipped in through the submarine bay...<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Deadlock: I'm gettin' too old fer this..."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P1909630278" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Eagle Eye: Somehow he didn't trip the alarms, he must have been cloaked from them somehow...<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Deadlock: Heh, the doc was right, that dermal cloak is working flawlessly..."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P3622138174" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Eagle Eye: Security wasn't complete lax, a few guards tried to stop him...<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Deadlock: Time to do this the old fashioned way..."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P1089476702" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Eagle Eye: ...but their communications were jammed, they couldn't raise the alarm...<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.3d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Deadlock: I knew that EM Jammer would come in handy..."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P3734792262" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Eagle Eye: Michael was running operations for the Freedom Phalanx at the time...<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Deadlock: I've been looking forward to this for a long time..."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P91513449" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Eagle Eye: Deadlock wandered around for a bit, maybe he was disoriented or checking for other exits...<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Deadlock: Where's the crapper in this joint anyway?"
// Script Variable Caption :
"P658027068" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Eagle Eye: Deadlock seemed to be extra cautious here, not wanting to take the direct route to where Brawler was standing...<t=7 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Deadlock: Stairwell, stairwell... where the hell are the stairs?"
// Script Variable Caption :
"P880962019" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Eagle Eye: Deadlock had some sort of serum, it gave him super strength and resilience...<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Deadlock: Time to even the playing field with that Praetorian serum I lifted from those eggheads..."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P1876934947" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Eagle Eye: Michael had never known his old friend to have been that strong...<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Deadlock: What's the matter, buddy? Fear got ya by the marbles?"
// Script Variable Caption :
"P2228991343" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Eagle Eye: It was clear that Deadlock was going to win. Michael just wanted to hold out as long as he could...<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Deadlock: You've lost, White. You know you've lost... bless you for being a stubborn old dog."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P845293407" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Eagle Eye: Michael said he'd never felt so powerless in his life. Soon he would be at the mercy of a man without remorse...<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Deadlock: Do you want to die yet, White? C'mon, we're old friends, you can tell me..."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P29953717" "<t=5 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkBlue><bgcolor Gold>Eagle Eye: The last of his strength spent, Michael collapsed. This was the end..."
