"P2062086462" "Positron, I'm getting some good data from your thermograph. Do another pass and let's see what we can see..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1700854697" "... Carver?!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P227869107" "Ungh! Good to see you too!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2615792977" "Calm down, Carver, we can talk about this!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1275080914" "Alright, I guess I'll speak a language you do understand!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3743757496" "What the hell did you take?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3212215315" "Ugh..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P184444419" "Carver, what the hell happened to you?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 5 Caption :
"P1586264223" "<x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Wake up, sunshine..."
// 4 Caption :
"P1763605083" "<x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor MediumSlateBlue>Ugh... What happened?"
// 0 Actor2 :
"P3340589100" "<em=talk t=5 d=5>"
// 5 Caption :
"P3351268154" "<x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>You used to be able to go a few rounds with me, White, you've gotten soft."
// 5 Caption :
"P3166896029" "<x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor MediumSlateBlue>Carver... I guess times have changed... What's it been... Twenty years?"
// 0 Actor2 :
"P4089449808" "<em=dustoff t=5 d=5>"
// 5 Caption :
"P3803059839" "<x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Twenty-three. But listen, you ain't got much time what with those broken ribs makin' ya bleed somethin' fierce on the insides... "
// 0 Actor2 :
"P2762022526" "<em=disagree t=5 d=5>"
// 5 Caption :
"P4106487204" "<x=0.3 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>So let's get the business outta the way before we catch up on old times, ya dig?"
// 3 Caption :
"P3733766555" "<x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor MediumSlateBlue>Business? Who hired you?"
// 2 Caption :
"P2578543649" "<x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>A pair of nut jobs called the Petrovic brothers."
// 0 Actor2 :
"P415031127" "<em=yourewelcome t=5 d=5>"
// 5 Caption :
"P2968631558" "<x=0.3 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Seems you done got them worried enough that they hired me to take you out of the picture for 'em."
// 3 Caption :
"P2731393989" "<x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor MediumSlateBlue>If you came here to kill me, then get it over with..."
// 0 Actor2 :
"P692689066" "<em=laugh t=3 d=3>"
// 3 Caption :
"P2028866153" "<x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Brother, if I was here to kill you, you'd be killed."
// 0 Actor2 :
"P2458882049" "<em=thanks t=3 d=3>"
// 3 Caption :
"P1059809621" "<x=0.3 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>I came here to offer you a life changing experience, just like you did for me."
// 0 Actor2 :
"P3427885679" "<em=knuckles t=3 d=3>"
// 3 Caption :
"P4050537187" "<x=0.3 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>But in order to do that... You're gonna have to hit rock bottom!"
// 3 Caption :
"P2781794523" "<x=0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Brother, when you wake up from that, I guarantee you'll be a changed man."
